language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario UiDiagnosticRouting.
condition UiDiagnosticRoutingReady.
condition UiDiagnosticRoutingContinue.
condition UiDiagnosticRoutingReject.
outcome UiDiagnosticRoutingCompleted.
outcome UiDiagnosticRoutingRejected.
step UiDiagnosticRoutingClassify.
step UiDiagnosticRoutingBound.
step UiDiagnosticRoutingDisplay.
step UiDiagnosticRoutingFailure.
step UiDiagnosticRoutingSuccess.

UiDiagnosticRouting illustrates InspectUiDiagnostics.
UiDiagnosticRouting exercises CorrelatedUiCommands.
UiDiagnosticRouting starts-when UiDiagnosticRoutingReady.
UiDiagnosticRouting starts-at UiDiagnosticRoutingClassify.
UiDiagnosticRoutingReady describes "A typed event enters a registered UI dispatch context.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
UiDiagnosticRouting preserves BoundedSubscribers.
UiDiagnosticRouting preserves GenericUiMechanisms.
UiDiagnosticRoutingClassify calls ClassifyUiRouting within BuckingUI.
UiDiagnosticRoutingClassify describes "Registered handlers, intentional ignore, failure and hidden output are distinct.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingClassify proceeds-to UiDiagnosticRoutingFailure when UiDiagnosticRoutingReject.
UiDiagnosticRoutingClassify proceeds-to UiDiagnosticRoutingBound when UiDiagnosticRoutingContinue.
UiDiagnosticRoutingBound calls ReportDiagnosticLoss within BuckingUI.
UiDiagnosticRoutingBound describes "Bounded storage/drop count, no recursive diagnostic storm.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingBound proceeds-to UiDiagnosticRoutingFailure when UiDiagnosticRoutingReject.
UiDiagnosticRoutingBound proceeds-to UiDiagnosticRoutingDisplay when UiDiagnosticRoutingContinue.
UiDiagnosticRoutingDisplay calls ReconcileViewNodes within BuckingUI.
UiDiagnosticRoutingDisplay describes "Expose diagnostic state without coupling handler existence to mounting.".
UiDiagnosticRoutingDisplay proceeds-to UiDiagnosticRoutingFailure when UiDiagnosticRoutingReject.
UiDiagnosticRoutingDisplay proceeds-to UiDiagnosticRoutingSuccess when UiDiagnosticRoutingContinue.
UiDiagnosticRoutingFailure finishes UiDiagnosticRouting with UiDiagnosticRoutingRejected.
UiDiagnosticRoutingSuccess finishes UiDiagnosticRouting with UiDiagnosticRoutingCompleted.
